      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Gains <style=dmg_bonus>+{[FULLY_FORMED_DMG]}/+{[FULLY_FORMED_CRIT]}</style> when fully formed
      - 
      - Gagne +{[FULLY_FORMED_DMG]}/+{[FULLY_FORMED_CRIT]} quand toutes les pièces sont réunies
      - Gana +{[FULLY_FORMED_DMG]}/+{[FULLY_FORMED_CRIT]} cuando se ensambla por completo
