      Languages:
      - Attacks deal <style=dmg_bonus>2x damage</style> but every <sprite name=PEG> <style=activate>Activated</style> gets downgraded <style=dmg_negative>(-{[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} damage)</style>.
      - 
      - Les attaques infligent <style=dmg_bonus>2x plus de dégâts</style>, mais chaque <sprite name=PEG> <style=activate>activé</style> est rétrogradé <style=dmg_negative>(-{[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} points de dégâts)</style>.
      - Los ataques infligen <style=dmg_bonus>2x daño</style>, pero cada <sprite name=PEG> <style=activate>Activada</style> se degrada <style=dmg_negative>(-{[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} de daño)</style>.
      - Angriffe verursachen <style=dmg_bonus>doppelten Schaden</style>, aber jeder <style=activate>aktivierte</style><sprite name="PEG"> wird geschwächt <style=dmg_negative>(-{[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} Schaden)</style>.
      - 
      - Gli attacchi infliggono <style=dmg_bonus>danni x2</style>, ma ogni <sprite name=PEG> <style=activate>attivato</style> perde <style=dmg_negative>-{[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} danni</style>.
      - Ataques causam <style=dmg_bonus>o dobro de dano</style>, mas cada <sprite name=PEG> <style=activate>ativado</style> é enfraquecido em <style=dmg_negative>(-{[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} de dano)</style>.
      - Атаки наносят <style=dmg_bonus>2x урона</style>, но каждый <sprite name=PEG> <style=activate>при активации</style> ухудшается <style=dmg_negative>(-{[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} урона)</style>.
      - 弹珠造成的<style=dmg_bonus>伤害翻倍</style>，但会减弱每个<style=activate>触发</style>的<sprite name=PEG>。（<style=dmg_negative>- {[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} 伤害</style>）
      - 彈珠造成的<style=dmg_bonus>傷害翻倍</style>，但會減弱每個<style=activate>觸發</style>的 <sprite name=PEG>。（<style=dmg_negative>-{[ALL_ORBS_DEBUFF_AMOUNT]} 傷害</style>）
