    - Term: Relics/crits_add_spinesse_desc
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Every {[CRITS_PER_SPINESSE_GAIN]} times a crit is triggered, gain <style=finesse>{[NUM_SPINESSE_GAIN_FOR_CRITS]} Spinesse</style>.
      - 
      - Gagnez <style=finesse>{[NUM_SPINESSE_GAIN_FOR_CRITS]} Souplesse</style> par palier de {[CRITS_PER_SPINESSE_GAIN]} coups critiques déclenchés.
