    - Term: Relics/high_ballusion_guaranteed_crit_desc
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Firing a shot when <style=dodge>above {[MIN_BALLUSION_FOR_GUARANTEED_CRIT]} Ballusion</style> triggers a crit.
      - 
      - Effectuer un tir quand vous avez <style=dodge>plus de {[MIN_BALLUSION_FOR_GUARANTEED_CRIT]} de Billusion</style> déclenche un coup critique.
