    - Term: Relics/low_health_increased_damage_desc2
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Deal <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x damage</style> when your health is <style=damage>below {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%</style>.
      - 
      - Inflige <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x vos dégâts</style> lorsque votre santé est <style=damage>inférieure à {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]} %</style>.
      - Infliges <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x de daño</style> cuando tienes <style=damage>menos del {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}% de salud</style>.
      - Verursache <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x Schaden</style>, wenn du <style=damage>unter {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}% Leben</style> hast.
      - Richt <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x schade</style> aan wanneer je leven <style=damage>minder dan {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%</style> is.
      - Infliggi <style=dmg_bonus>danni x{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}</style> quando la tua salute è <style=damage>inferiore al {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%</style>.
      - Causa <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x o dano</style> quando estiver <style=damage>abaixo de {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}% de sua Vida</style>.
      - Вы наносите <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x урона</style>, когда ваши ОЗ опускаются <style=damage>ниже {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%</style>.
      - 当你的血量<style=damage>低于 {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}% 时</style>造成 <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]} 倍伤害</style>。
      - 當<style=damage>你的血量低於 {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}% </style>時，<style=dmg_bonus>造成 {[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]} 倍傷害</style>。
      - "残りHPが<style=damage>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}％以下</style>の時、\n<style=dmg_bonus>ダメージ加算量×{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}</style>。"
      - 체력이 <style=damage>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}% 미만</style>일 경우 공격이 <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}배</style>의 대미지를 줍니다.
      - Gör <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x damage</style> när din hälsa är <style=damage>under {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%</style>.
      - Zadajesz <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x więcej obrażeń</style>, gdy twoje PŻ jest <style=damage>poniżej {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%</style>.
      - Canın {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%.altında olduğunda {[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]}x hasar vur
      - 
      - Наносить у <style=dmg_bonus>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]} разів більше втрат</style> коли у тебе менше <style=damage>{[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%</style> ОЗ.[i2p_Few] {[MONSTER_TRAINING_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER]} рази більше втрат</style> коли у тебе менше <style=damage>below {[MONSTER_TRAINING_HEALTH_THRESHOLD]}%</style> ОЗ.
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
