    - Term: Relics/matryoshka_desc2
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Every shot gains <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multiball</style>, but attacks lose <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}/{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      - 
      - Chaque tir a <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multibille</style>, mais les attaques ont <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}/{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      - Cada tiro tiene <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multibola</style>, pero los ataques obtienen <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]} /{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      - Jeder Schuss hat <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multiball-Level</style>, aber alle Angriffe haben <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}/{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      - 
      - Ogni lancio ottiene <style=multiball>Multisfera +{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]}</style>, ma gli attacchi perdono <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]} /{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      - Cada arremesso tem <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multibola</style>, mas ataques possuem <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}/ {[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      - Каждый выстрел обладает <style=multiball>Мультишаром Ур.{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]}</style>, но атаки получают <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]} /{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      - 每次发射弹珠都额外附加 {[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} 层<style=multiball>分裂</style>效果，但攻击造成的<style=dmg_negative>普通伤害 {[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}/暴击伤害 {[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]} </style>。
      - 每次發射彈珠時，都額外附加 {[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} 層<style=multiball>分裂</style>，但所有彈珠的傷害 <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}/{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>。
      - "オーブの ｽﾀｯﾂ <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}/{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>。\n\n全てのオーブに\n『<style=multiball>マルチボール</style>:{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]}』を\n付与する。"
      - 매번 발사할 때마다 <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} 멀티볼</style>을 얻지만, 공격은 <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}/{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>를 잃습니다.
      - 
      - Każdy strzał ma <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multikulkę</style>,ale ataki dostają <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]} / {[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      - 
      - 
      - Кожен постріл має <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Мультикулю</style>, але атаки отримують <style=dmg_negative>{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]} /{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_DAMAGE]}</style>.
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Relics/matryoshka_desc3
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Every shot gains <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multiball</style>, but created <style=multiball>Multiballs</style> are smaller than their source orb.
      - 
      - Chaque tir a <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multibille</style>, mais les orbes et les <style=multiball>Multibilles</style> rétrécissent après chaque séparation.
      - Cada tiro tiene <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multibola</style>, pero los orbes y <style=multiball>Multibolas</style> encogen con cada división.
      - Jeder Schuss hat <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multiball-Level</style>, aber alle Orbs und <style=multiball>Multibälle</style> schrumpfen mit jeder Spaltung.
      - 
      - Ogni lancio ottiene <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multisfera</style>, ma le sfere e le <style=multiball>Multisfere</style> si rimpiccioliscono a ogni divisione.
      - Cada arremesso tem <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Multibola</style>, mas orbes e <style=multiball>Multibolas</style> diminuem de tamanho a cada divisão.
      - Каждый выстрел имеет <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Мультишар</style>, но шары и <style=multiball>Мультишары</style> уменьшаются с каждым разделением.
      - 每次发射弹珠时，都额外附加 {[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} 层<style=multiball>分裂</style>，但该弹珠和<style=multiball>分裂体</style>在分裂后会越变越小。
      - 每次發射彈珠時，都額外附加 {[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} 層<style=multiball>分裂</style>，但該彈珠和<style=multiball>分裂體</style>在分裂後會越變越小。
      - "全てのオーブに\n『<style=multiball>マルチボール</style>:{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]}』を\n付与する。\n\n<style=multiball>オーブ分裂</style>時、\n当該オーブはそれぞれ\n元よりも小さくなる。"
      - 매번 발사할 때마다 <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} 멀티볼</style>을 얻지만, 생성된 <style=multiball>멀티볼</style>은 원래 구슬보다 작습니다.
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - Кожен постріл має <style=multiball>+{[MULTIBALL_RELIC_MULTIBALL]} Мультикулі</style>, але створені <style=multiball>Мультикулі</style> меньше оригінальної.
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
