    - Term: Relics/no_discard_desc
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - You gain <style=balance>{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} Ballance</style> at the start of battle and whenever you reload, but you have <style=damage>-{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} orb discards</style>.
      - 
      - Au début du combat et quand vous rechargez, vous gagnez <style=balance>{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} Équilibre</style>, mais vous devez alors défausser <style=damage>-{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} orbes</style>.
      - Al comienzo de la batalla y al recargar ganas <style=balance>{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} Equilibola</style>, pero tienes <style=damage>-{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} descartes de orbes</style>.
      - Zu Beginn des Kampfes und mit jedem Nachladen erhältst du <style=balance>{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} Ballance</style>, aber du kannst <style=damage>{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} Orbs weniger abwerfen</style>.
      - 
      - All’inizio della battaglia e quando ricarichi ottieni <style=balance>{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} Contrappalla</style>, ma hai a disposizione <style=damage>-{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} possibilità di scartare sfere</style>.
      - No início da batalha e quando você recarrega, você ganha <style=balance>{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} Orbalanceamento</style>, mas você tem <style=damage>-{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} descartes de orbe</style>.
      - В начале сражения и после перезарядки вы получаете <style=balance>{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} Шаравновесия</style>, но количество сбросов уменьшается на {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]}
      - 在战斗开始和重新装填时，你会获得 {[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} 层<style=balance>圆满</style>，但你<style=damage>可跳过弹珠的次数 - {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} </style>。
      - 在戰鬥開始以及裝填彈珠時，你將獲得 {[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} 層<style=balance>圓滿</style>，但<style=damage>你每次可棄用的彈珠量 -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} 個</style>。
      - "戦闘開始・リロード時、\n『<style=balance>バランス</style>:{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}』を\n自身に付与する。\n\n<style=damage>破棄できるオーブ -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]}</style>"
      - 전투 시작 시와 재장전할 때마다 <style=balance>균형 {[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}</style>을 얻지만, <style=damage>구슬 버리기 횟수가 -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]}</style>됩니다.
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - Отримаєте <style=balance>{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} Кулянсу</style> на початку битви та при перезарядці, але матимите <style=damage>-{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} скидувань куль</style>.
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Relics/no_discard_desc2
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - All attacks gain <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/+{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> but you have <style=damage>-{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} orb discards</style>.
      - 
      - Toutes les attaques reçoivent <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/+{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style>, mais vous avez {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} défausse(s) d’orbe en moins.
      - Todos los ataques obtienen <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} / +{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> pero tienes -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} descartes de orbes.
      - '<style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/+{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> für alle Angriffe, aber du kannst {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} Orbs weniger ablegen.[i2p_One]<style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/+{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> für alle Angriffe, aber du kannst ein Orb weniger ablegen.'
      - Alle aanvallen krijgen <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} / +{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> maar je kunt {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} bol(len) minder afleggen.
      - Tutti gli attacchi ottengono <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} / +{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> ma hai -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} possibilità di scartare sfere.
      - Todos ataques possuem <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} / +{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> mas você tem -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} descartes de orbes.
      - Все атаки получают <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} / +{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style>, но число сбросов уменьшается на {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]}.
      - 所有攻击造成的<style=dmg_bonus>普通伤害 + {[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/暴击伤害 + {[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> ，但你可跳过弹珠的次数 - {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} 。
      - 所有彈珠的傷害 <style=dmg_bonus>+ {[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/+ {[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style>，但你每次可棄用的彈珠量 -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} 個。
      - "オーブの ｽﾀｯﾂ <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}</style>。\n破棄できるオーブ -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]}"
      - 모든 공격이 <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/+{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style>를 얻지만, <style=damage>구슬 버리기가 {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} 감소합니다</style>.
      - 
      - Wszystkie ataki zyskują <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]}/+{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]} do obrażeń</style>, ale liczba twoich odrzuceń kulek jest zmniejszona o {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]}.
      - Bütün saldırılar <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} / +{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style> kazanır ama artık -{[DISCARD_REDUCTION]} topu çöpe atabilirsin.
      - 
      - Всі атаки отримують <style=dmg_bonus>+{[NO_DISCARD_DAMAGE_INCREASE]} / +{[NO_DISCARD_CRIT_INCREASE]}</style>, але кількість скидів зменшується на {[DISCARD_REDUCTION]}.
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
