    - Term: Relics/post_battle_heal_increase_desc
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Post battle healing is increased by <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> for each orb in your deck. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - 
      - Les soins après bataille sont augmentés de <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]} %</style> pour chaque orbe dans votre deck. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]} %)</style>
      - La curación posbatalla aumenta en <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> por cada orbe en tu mazo. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - Wenn du dich nach einem Kampf heilst, heile zusätzliche <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}% HP</style> für jedes Orb in deinem Deck. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - Heling na gevechten wordt verhoogd met <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> voor elke bol in je dek. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - La guarigione post battaglia è aumentata di <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> per ogni sfera nel tuo mazzo. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - Aumenta a cura após a batalha em <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> para cada orbe no seu baralho. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>.
      - После боя вы <style=heal>лечите на {[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> больше ОЗ за каждый шар в сумке <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - 战后选择回血时，根据弹珠库中的弹珠数量，每有一颗弹珠可额外恢复<style=heal> {[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}% </style>血量。<style=heal>（ + {[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}% ）</style>
      - 戰後選擇治療時，你的彈珠袋中每有一顆彈珠，就可<style=heal>額外治療 {[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}% 血量</style>。（<style=heal>+ {[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%</style>）
      - "戦闘後に\nHP回復を\n選択した時の回復量が、\n所持オーブ数に応じて\n<style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}％</style> ずつ増加する。\n<style=heal>（+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}％）</style>"
      - 전투 후 회복량이 덱에 있는 구슬 하나당 <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> 증가합니다. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - Heandet efter strider ökas med <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> för varje klot i din lek <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - Leczenie po walce jest zwiększone o <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> za każdą kulkę w twojej kolekcji. <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - Destendeki her top için savaş sonrası iyileşme <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> artar.<style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>
      - 
      - Після бою ти відновлюєш на <style=heal>{[POST_BATTLE_HEAL_BY_ORBS]}%</style> більше ОЗ за кожну кулю в сумці <style=heal>(+{[DECK_SIZE_HEAL_TOTAL]}%)</style>.
      Flags: 000000000000000000000000000000000000
      Languages_Touch: []
