    - Term: Relics/reduce_orb_self_damage_desc
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Reduce <style=damage>self-damage</style> from orbs by {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%.
      - 
      - Réduit les <style=damage>auto-dégâts</style> des orbes de {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]} %.
      - Reduce el <style=damage>autodaño</style> infligido por los orbes en un {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%.
      - Reduziert <style=damage>selbstzugefügten Schaden</style> durch Orbs um {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%.
      - Verminder <style=damage>zelfschade</style> door bollen met {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%.
      - Riduci i <style=damage>danni autoinflitti</style> da tutte le sfere di -{[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%.
      - Reduz o <style=damage>dano a si mesmo</style> de orbes em {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%.
      - Снижает <style=damage>самоурон</style> от шаров на {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%.
      - 弹珠对<style=damage>自身造成的伤害</style>减少 {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%。
      - 來自彈珠的<style=damage>自殘傷害</style> 減少 {[REDUCE_ORB_SELF_DMG]}%。
