    - Term: Relics/reverse_gravity_name
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Viridian Trinket
      - A refrence to the game VVVVVV (a game about reversing gravity). The main characters of this game is named Viridian, but viridian is also the name of a color that looks blue-ish green. In VVVVVV you also collect trinkets, thus the name Viridian Trinket.
      - Colifichet viridien
      - Varatija Viridiana
      - Viridianschmuck
