    - Term: Relics/double_status_effects_desc
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - "Status effects you apply have <style=dmg_bonus>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}x intensity</style>, but attacks have \n<style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>."
      - 'The new line in the this description is just to make the english formatting look nicer. You don''t have to add any new lines in the translations. '
      - Les effets que vous appliquez ont {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}x plus d'intensité, mais les attaques ont <style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>.
      - Los efectos de estado que aplicas tienen {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}x de intensidad, pero los ataques tienen <style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>.
      - Statuseffekte, die du zufügst, haben {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}x Intensität, aber Angriffe haben <style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>.
      - 
      - Gli effetti di stato applicati presentano intensità x{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}, ma gli attacchi hanno <style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>.
      - Efeitos aplicados por você têm {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}x de intensidade, mas ataques têm <style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>.
      - Интенсивность применяемых эффектов статуса увеличена в {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]} раза, но урон от атак уменьшается на <style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>.
      - 你施加的状态有 {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]} 倍效果，但你的弹珠<style=dmg_negative> 普通伤害 {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/暴击伤害 {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>。
      - 你施加的狀態有 {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]} 倍效果，但你的彈珠傷害會<style=dmg_negative> {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>。
      - "オーブの ｽﾀｯﾂ <style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>。\n\n自身が付与する\nバフ・デバフの\n付与量×{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}。"
      - "부여하는 상태 효과가 <style=dmg_bonus>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}배의 강도</style>를 가지지만, 공격은 \n <style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>를 갖습니다."
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - "Накладені вами статуси мають {[DOUBLE_STATUSES_MULT]}x інтенсивності, але атаки мають\n<style=dmg_negative>{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_REG_DMG_LOSS]}/{[DOUBLE_STATUSES_CRIT_DMG_LOSS]}</style>."
