    - Term: Relics/gain_ballusion_on_dodge_desc
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - Whenever you <style=dodge>evade an attack</style>, gain <style=dodge>{[DUCK_DODGE]} Ballusion</style>.
      - 
      - Lorsque vous <style=dodge>esquivez une attaque</style>, confère <style=dodge>{[DUCK_DODGE]} Billusion</style>.
      - Cada vez que <style=dodge>esquivas un ataque</style>, obtienes <style=dodge> {[DUCK_DODGE]} Bolusiones </style>.
      - Jedes Mal, wenn du <style=dodge>einem Angriff ausweichst</style>, erhältst du <style=dodge>{[DUCK_DODGE]} Ballweichen</style>.
      - 
      - Ogni volta che <style=dodge>schivi un attacco</style> ottieni <style=dodge>{[DUCK_DODGE]} Pallusione</style>.
      - Sempre que <style=dodge>se esquivar de um ataque</style>, ganhe <style=dodge>{[DUCK_DODGE]} Orbilusão</style>.
      - Когда вы <style=dodge>уворачиваетесь от атаки</style>, вы получаете <style=dodge>{[DUCK_DODGE]} Стремячельности</style>.
      - "每当你因<style=dodge>幻象</style>而躲避攻击时，获得 {[DUCK_DODGE]} 层<style=dodge>幻象</style>。\n"
      - "每當你因<style=dodge>幻象</style>而躲避攻擊時，獲得 {[DUCK_DODGE]} 層<style=dodge>幻象</style>。\n"
      - "攻撃を<style=dodge>回避</style>する度、\n『<style=dodge>幻影</style>:{[DUCK_DODGE]}』を\n自身に付与する。"
      - '<style=dodge>공격을 회피할</style> 때마다 <style=dodge>{[DUCK_DODGE]} 환각</style>을 얻습니다.'
