      - You retain {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}% <style=dodge>Ballusion</style> when <style=dodge>Ballusion</style> triggers, and <style=dodge>unused Ballusion</style> is retained between battles.
      - 
      - Vous gardez {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]} % de <style=dodge>Billusion</style> quand <style=dodge>Billusion</style> se déclenche, et tout effet <style=dodge>Billusion inutilisé</style> est conservé entre les combats.
      - Conservas {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]} % <style=dodge>Bolusiones</style> cuando <style=dodge>Bolusión</style> se activa, y las <style=dodge>Bolusiones inactivas</style> se conservan entre cada batalla.
      - Du behältst {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}% deines <style=dodge>Ballweichens</style>, wenn es ausgelöst wird. Ungenutztes <style=dodge>Ballweichen</style> bleibt zwischen Kämpfen erhalten.
      - 
      - Mantieni {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}% di <style=dodge>Pallusione</style> quando questa <style=dodge>Pallusione</style> viene attivata, mentre quella inutilizzata si conserva fra le battaglie.
      - Você mantém {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}% de <style=dodge>Orbilusão</style> quando <style=dodge>Orbilusão</style> é ativada, e todo <style=dodge>Orbilusão não utilizado</style> é mantido entre batalhas.
      - Вы сохраняете {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}% <style=dodge>Стремячельности</style> при её активации, а <style=dodge>неиспользованная Стремячельность</style> сохраняется между боями.
      - 当<style=dodge>幻象</style>生效时，你会保留 {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}% 的<style=dodge>幻象</style>层数，并且未用完的<style=dodge>幻象</style>层数会保留到下一场战斗。
      - 當<style=dodge>幻象</style>生效時，你會保留 {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}% 的<style=dodge>幻象</style>層數，並且未用完的<style=dodge>幻象</style>層數會保留到下一場戰鬥。
      - "『<style=dodge>幻影</style>』発動時、\nその{[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}％を\n維持する。\n\n未使用の『<style=dodge>幻影</style>』を\n各戦闘に引き継ぐ。"
      - '<style=dodge>환각</style>이 발동될 때 <style=dodge>환각</style>의 {[LOSE_LESS_BALLUSION_NEW_PERCENT]}%를 유지하며, <style=dodge>사용되지 않은 환각</style>은 전투 간에 유지됩니다.'
