    - Term: Relics/ballusion_doubled_desc
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - All <style=dodge>Ballusion</style> you gain is doubled, but <style=damage>you lose twice as much</style> <style=dodge>Ballusion</style> when <style=dodge>Ballusion</style> triggers.
      - 
      - Tous les effets <style=dodge>Billusion</style> que vous obtenez sont doublés, mais <style=damage>vous perdez deux fois plus de</style> <style=dodge>Billusion</style> quand <style=dodge>Billusion</style> se déclenche.
      - Todas las <style=dodge>Bolusiones</style> que obtengas se duplican, pero <style=damage>pierdes el doble de</style> <style=dodge>Bolusiones</style> cuando <style=dodge>Bolusión</style> se activa.
      - Du erhältst doppeltes <style=dodge>Ballweichen</style> aus allen Quellen, aber <style=damage>verlierst doppelt so viel</style> <style=dodge>Ballweichen</style>, wenn es ausgelöst wird.
      - 
      - Tutta la <style=dodge>Pallusione</style> ottenuta è raddoppiata, ma <style=damage>ne perdi il doppio</style> quando <style=dodge>Pallusione</style> viene attivata.
      - Todo <style=dodge>Orbilusão</style> que você ganha é dobrado, mas <style=damage>você perde o dobro de</style> <style=dodge>Orbilusão</style> quando <style=dodge>Orbilusão</style> é ativado.
      - Вся получаемая <style=dodge>Стремячельность</style> удваивается, но <style=damage>вы теряете в два раза больше </style> <style=dodge>Стремячельности</style> при её активации.
      - "你获得的所有<style=dodge>幻象</style>层数都会加倍，但当<style=dodge>幻象</style>生效时<style=damage>失去的层数也会加倍</style>。\n"
      - "你獲得的所有<style=dodge>幻象</style>層數都會加倍，但當<style=dodge>幻象</style>生效時<style=damage>失去的層數也會加倍</style>。\n"
      - "『<style=dodge>幻影</style>』付与量×2。\n\n『<style=dodge>幻影</style>』発動時の\n<style=damage>減少量×2</style>。"
      - 획득하는 모든 <style=dodge>환각</style>이 두 배가 되지만, <style=dodge>환각</style>이 발동될 때 <style=dodge>환각</style>을 <style=damage>두 배로 잃습니다</style>.
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
      - 
